{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "321babcbc9dc3ee167d7e7dabe76d4e9f605432f5d61c8416b701f3fe08213b6", "ja": "（今日は奈緒のPV撮影だ。スタジオの準備は\n終わったけど、奈緒の様子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（今天奈绪要拍摄PV。摄影棚已经准备就绪，\n奈绪的情况如何呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b6388022d92ba79d94736a7f8090d3c361feb35a8297cca943eb5793d593c3e", "ja": "あかん……どう考えても、私のイメージとちゃう……。\nやっぱり、屋根にソースとか壁にアオノリとかを……。", "zh": "糟糕……不管怎么想都跟我的形象不合吼……\n屋顶还是要淋酱汁，墙壁要用海苔才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bfe6af0ff55a31f5a8af6c903e8c2cf880f408d1f7ca245ef2fb8bc4a17b8163", "ja": "奈緒、お疲れさま……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "奈绪，辛苦了……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "2e15d236717de4d0e7a5371546e55ee160a81f1b7dd634adc8128f6eff710f87", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nあの、今日の撮影のセットなんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那个，关于今天拍摄的布景……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d95bd33c839810b87856f91463739aa5bf24bbb552a4a33a718339eb71074f3e", "ja": "ああ、お菓子の家のことか？\nすごく凝ってて可愛いな。綺麗だし……。", "zh": "哦，你是说糖果屋吗？\n非常精致可爱，而且又很漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "58ff50d838a2b2e917c61327819103aedf4e614dddb42b1cb9a5cf58374b6f55", "ja": "そう！　それなんです！\n凝っててかわいくって、綺麗すぎるんですよ～！", "zh": "没错！问题就出在这！\n实在太过精致可爱，太过漂亮啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "04f12303db7d2ffe1157f83136f5683167aeceb77cfb5e5d35a9ca3e1d9687e6", "ja": "何かいけなかったか？", "zh": "这有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b6b50d27a491ccd1c841610c3b6fda65d07207d5cd014b0df26d463324ab02f", "ja": "いや、女子っぽいと思うんです！　飴ちゃんやら\nチョコやらクッキーやら、めっちゃキラキラしてて！", "zh": "不是啦，我觉得非常有少女气息！\n糖果、巧克力跟饼干都非常耀眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "3c48d6fdca161a1716483f6822cc3239d563956071a8eea9d591d8821a14f7e7", "ja": "でもな、ファンシーって言うんですか？\nなんや私にはかわいすぎる気して……。", "zh": "但是吼，该说是太梦幻了吗？\n总觉得对我来说太可爱了咩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "bd168a991c22f82af28d14800c6dfcdc046b6b5c93303e585c6259db943195d4", "ja": "私のイメージやったら、やっぱりタコ焼きとか\nお好み焼きとか、粉もん！ソース！ってほうが……。", "zh": "按照我的形象，还是比较适合章鱼烧\n或大阪烧之类的啦，总之就是面食！还有酱汁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8e80d411fe41245bc349d04df069780485d3cc8fc0388e40d7019a5e646086a1", "ja": "まあまあ奈緒、少し落ち着こう。それにタコ焼きと\nお好み焼きじゃ、お菓子の家とは言えないだろ？", "zh": "别激动，奈绪，你冷静一点。\n而且做成章鱼烧跟大阪烧，就不能叫做糖果屋了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "3f44aa785a8a35d10cb264f7fdb579b0a70df1c9fe7bd27bb1ff5645edc3dffb", "ja": "でも……かわいすぎません？", "zh": "可是……不会太可爱了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1012_p", "source_sha256": "37f07d30654f359a62d1f7b0f449a231a08168caeeb6b65842da4433025685d9", "ja": "可愛くてもいいんじゃないか？\nヘンゼルとグレーテルのお菓子の家なんだから。", "zh": "这么可爱不是很好吗？\n毕竟是童话故事里的糖果屋嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "deef5b4d2b3050482904dbff55e6a58fbcb263371f6e76b7f2f664be60ff5dbe", "ja": "せやけど、こんな絵本みたいなイメージ、\n私に出せるんかなって……。", "zh": "是没错啦，\n但我能表现出这种童话风格吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "aac01528c64986aab35fee42015b5c7815ada79e0194671008277685bf6eecb8", "ja": "アカン、不安になってきた……。", "zh": "不妙，我开始觉得不安啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9fafc51470ca7192975eb951a45aa9b3418a20531abb150c9cf3eec1785d82ac", "ja": "（奈緒……可愛らしいセットを見て、\n気後れしてしまったみたいだな。でも……）", "zh": "（奈绪……看见可爱的布景后，\n好像让她心生畏缩了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_1016", "source_sha256": "b0d5c534a49495549fdcc44ed3f09a146fd6af46531c251aa43c09d2f736cb0b", "ja": "可愛いから大丈夫！", "zh": "很可爱，所以没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cabc34a4a1c63ff636a7b50e9d864cf0cbd70eb7b632c927e0dc01dba4f66a82", "ja": "大丈夫。今の奈緒は、お菓子の家の可愛さに負けない\n最高に可愛いグレーテルだ。保証するよ！", "zh": "没问题的，现在的奈绪是最可爱的葛丽特，\n可爱程度并不输糖果屋，我敢保证喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "73a140ea4235d94fb7aca80df5cff59cbbb16779428e9c27ffac6a7640d69334", "ja": "えっ……ほんまに？\n{$P$}さん、ほんまにそう思います？", "zh": "咦……真的吗？\n{$P$}先生，你真的这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a2b0a3d1d81c0e76da17e68e3054d88651b45b867686fa63a00a4bd7c9c203ec", "ja": "もちろん。\nほら、そろそろ本番だぞ。元気に行ってこい！", "zh": "当然。\n好了，差不多要正式开拍了，打起精神吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "949f70386cd64e3c89956c767d318f3fd92d03959fa701a8c8c9be46736daa37", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わかりました！\n私、メッチャかわいなるよう、がんばってきます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我知道啦！\n我这就去努力让自己变得超级可爱嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "6b68278fef11c428dc6a34bead50d32312c56aeae82fd86f82f2e6ed5d8d38db", "ja": "あっ、そうや！　{$P$}さん、\nそこのタコ焼き、冷めへんうちに食べといてください！", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生，\n我放在那里的章鱼烧，请你趁热吃掉嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "39ca4d5210ed655bcb3f76b5af83063481177748892bd93312c3454bf40fc080", "ja": "なんや、使わんで済みそうなんで……\nほな、いってきます！", "zh": "因为好像用不到章鱼烧了咩……\n那我去拍摄啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2006_p", "source_sha256": "931a64089f84ef177fad332730358da66d4752805ca92cbe9d4a79ea8243f30c", "ja": "たこ焼き？\n本当だ、わざわざ用意したのか……。", "zh": "章鱼烧？\n她还真的特地准备了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0114_2007_p", "source_sha256": "daa5a1c596e93fb205cb09e969fe3be2676ce78f95b72f0d6666a886f8f2ecf0", "ja": "はふっ、ほふ……うん、美味しいな。", "zh": "呼、呼……嗯，真好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
